<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Teke-Tyee</book>
  <para style="h">EFEDZE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Efedze</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaana a Poole kundaa basi Efedze</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukaana a Poole Kundaa basi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Efedze</para>
  <para style="imt">OSOMO</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu me mukaana wu ósono Poole kundaa bangaa a kana ba bali ku Efedze. Lo nde ka ásono mukaana wu yini a mu nkooro a bo o, mu kuulu, mu mikaana milagha mi mikulu, ka básono kwumu yi a «Efedze» mu etsulu kii nsomo o. Odzyi osuo ti Poole ásono mukaana wu kundaa banga-a-kana baba mabvulu malagha mama ku etsulu e nsie kii Adzi, mpaala bo bamana otaŋa nde, bagwa nde kundaa banganda. Nde ásono mukaana wu mu matala ma áli nde mu boloko ku Rome.</para>
  <para style="ip">Efedze líli bvulu li libvulu mupfunu ŋa kara li mabvulu mwohono mama empu kii Rome ma máli ku Adzi. Baara balagha ŋa kara li baara ba bákakala oko báli minta-nkaala. Bo bátwu nzaami a bo wu a nkwumu Aretemise nzo yi a nkara bubwe. Basi-Rome baakata nde mu nkwumu yi a Dyane. Aretemise áli etyeghe mu efaana kii mukaha. Bo bákagye mu nzo yi a nkara mbwe oyo mu okayisamana kye. Baara bwohono baba oko bákasa kana mu etyeghe ekye, maha ba-Dzwife ya bakriste. Mu matala ma obvughuru Poole ku Efedze mu midzye mi nde mimi myele, nde áluo ba-Dzwife baba oko mu etsughu kii Sabate. Ŋa mbihi, nde abvughuru mu kuulu nde ka ákughu ogyili oko o, lo nde ályele bo ti nde faana obvughuru. Mu matala ma abvughuru nde mu midzye mimi mitere, nde ási bamvulu batere mu okaluo baara matala mwohono (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 19-20">Big 19–20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mandagha ma me ma ookasuo Poole munsa mukaana wu: Nzaami aasuo bihi mandagha ma básweghe ma akuru nde mu bubwe bu nde. Mbaala ti, nde sa abvughu bilogho byehene bibi ku mayulu, ya bi bili ŋa nsie mpaala Yiisu akala Mfumu. Nde ábwehe ti bakriste bafaana ogwihini ya okala ti anga bandughu mu kana. Ka bafaana olyele o ti wu mu-Dzwife, wunii ka li mu-Dzwife o. Mutaara a bo li yini a mumõ, me Satana. Mu obo, bo bafaana okasamana ŋa emõ mpaala Satana anyaã okala a litumu ŋa yulu a bo. Poole áfirilyele bunu a bo baghala afaana okala ya mukala a nde, bunu a bo baana bafaana ogwolo bataara ba bo, bunu a bo bankana bafaana okagwolo bamfumu ba bo. Nde ályele ti banga-a-kana bafaana okala bumõ ya Kriste.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">Bu me bu baakakaba mukaana wu:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Mamboro (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Kriste seme bihi ya Mufulu a Ngili (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1.3–3.21</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Litswe likala a bumweẽ bu bunyaghara emõ ya Kriste (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4.1–6.20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Mamboro mama masini (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6.21-24</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mamboro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Me Poole, ntumu a Yiisu-Kriste mu waa li Nzaami, nsono mukaana wu kundaa baba ngili ba bali ku bvulu lili Efedze, ba baakasa kana mu Yiisu-Kriste: <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Nyaã bwehe ya edzuunu bi bifi kundaa Nzaami Taara a bihi ya kundaa Mfumu Yiisu-Kriste bikala ya be!<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Liseme lili mukughu mu Kriste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Masyighi kundaa Nzaami, Taara a Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste, nde wu aaseme bihi mu Kriste mu liseme lwohono lili mufulu mu mayulu. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Mu nde, Nzaami ásuolo bihi nsomo nde agyighili nsie, mpaala bihi likala baba ngili, ba bagwene a epfwumu ŋa busu bu nde. Mu dzyi li nde, Nzaami <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />átswamagwolo munkaana mu osa ti bihi likala baana ba nde mu Yiisu-Kriste, ti bwunu a bu oli waa li nde li libwe, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />mu kuulu bihi lisyighi nsia a bwehe bu nde, bwehe bu aapfwaha nde bihi mu mwana a nde wu a dzyi.<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Mu makili ma Yiisu, Nzaami aakwulu bihi, nde aasi masumu ma bihi kolokolo, ti bwunu a bu oli busini bu bwehe bu nde. <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Nzaami aapfwaha bihi bo kunsa bunsughu bwohono ya mayele mwohono. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Nde aasuo bihi mansweghe ma waa li nde, bitsimi bi bibwe bi átswama okuru nde mu Kriste, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />mu okuhu bye ŋa ookughu matala mpaala abvughu byehene kunsa litumu li Kriste, byehene bi bili mu mayulu ya bi bili ŋa nsie.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Mu Kriste bihi si liibagha kaba lili pfa, bihi ba básuolo nsomo ti bwunu a bu oli bitsimi bi ókuru munde wu aakagyighili mandagha mwohono ti bwunu a bu oli munkaana a waa li nde, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />mpaala lisyighi nsia a nde, bihi ba lítswama osa emiini e bihi mu Kriste.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Mu nde, behe si bu ligyughu mandagha mama ngaŋma, nsia yi mbwe yi a obvwughu o be, mu nde si be liisi kana ya baasi be elyimi kii Mufulu a Ngili wu básiini a be. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Mufulu munde li kaba lili nsomo mu pfa li liibagha bihi. Bihi sa libagha lo mu matala ma baakwulu bihi kuu mukughu, mpaala bihi lisyighi nsia a nde.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osamana o Poole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Me mu obo mehe-si, bu aangyughu bu bali mu okabili mu kana li be mu Mfumu Yiisu ya mu dzyi li lili a be mu baba ngili bwohono, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />me ndi mu okabvurulu matuono mu be matala mwohono. Ya me aakansamana mu be. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Nyaã Nzaami a Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste, Taara wu a nsia, agwa be mufulu wu a bunsughu ya wu aakasuo mandagha mama ensweghe, wu aasa ti be lisoolo nde. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Nyaã Nzaami abaha mikolo mi be mu obaghala ya osoolo nki emiini ki bákuru mu mbili yi áti nde be, nki busini bubu nsia a pfa li nde ŋa kara li baba ngili, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />ya nki bunene bu lileene nde aasuo kundaa bihi ba liikasa kana, lileene lilo li aasuo nde ya mpini yohono.<verse eid="EPH 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />Nde aasuo lileene lilo bu aasiili Kriste ŋa kara li ba bákpi ya aabwihi nde nsini ŋa kwogho-a-kwogho e nde mu mayulu. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Mu obo, Kriste li ŋa yulu a bimfumu byehene, litumu lwohono, lileene lwohono, empu kyehene ya nswe nkwumu yi bakughu otaŋana, ka yini a mu matala ma o, lo ya mu matala ma maagya si. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" /><char style="qt">Nzaami aasuhu byehene ku nsie a myili mi Kriste</char>, ya nde aatwulu nde mu okala mutswi ŋa yulu a byehene, mutswi a libwunu li Nzaami, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />li lili nyuru a nde, mukughu wu a munde wu aakaluhu byehene mu baara bwohono.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Obvughu mu bwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Lo be, be áli líipki mu nkooro a bibili bi be ya masumu ma be. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Be áli líikanama bipfu bi baara ba nsie yi, be líikanama litumu li mfumu a mifulu mi mili mu engie-a-ngie. Me mufulu munde li mu okasala mu matala ma mu ba baakabihi litumu li Nzaami. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Bihi bwohono si líili ti anga bo ya mu nsi-nkulu líikabuludzyara bwunu a bu oli dzyi li embwuru e bihi, mu okabulugyighili mi odzyi nyuru ya bitsimi bi bihi. Mu nzya-nzyara a bihi, bihi líili baara baala nkehe a Nzaami yífaana obwa mu bihi ti anga mu babake. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Lo Nzaami alwulu mu nyiĩ, ya mu nkooro a dzyi li linene li adzyi nde bihi, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />bihi baala áli líikpi mu nkooro a masumu ma bihi, nde aabvurulu bihi baba mweẽ emõ ya Kriste. Me mu bwehe bu Nzaami be liibvwughu. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Nde aasiili bihi mu lipfu ya aabwihi bihi nsini mu mayulu emõ ya Yiisu-Kriste, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />mu osuo mu matala ma maagya, busini bu bwehe bu nde bu bubvulu olagha, mu bubwe bu nde kundaa bihi mu Yiisu-Kriste.<verse eid="EPH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Mu kuulu, me mu bwehe baabvwuhu be, mu nzili a kana. Obvwughu oko ka ofi kundaa beme o, ko oli ekaba e Nzaami. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Ka oli mu nkooro a bigyighili o, mpaala mbwuru si mumõ anyaã okala a mutwunu. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Mu kuulu bihi lili baara ba ógyighili Nzaami. Nde áagyighili bihi mu Yiisu-Kriste mpaala likala a bigyighili bi bibwe, bigyighili bi átswama okuru nde, buulu bihi lisalala bye.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba-Dzwife ya baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o bali mbwuru mumõ mu Kriste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Mu obo, liikalibili mweẽ mu ndagha yi: Mu nsi-nkulu be líili baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o mu musunu, bákalyele be ti ba bágwene osomo nzo a mbaa kundaa ba baakatsimi ti bo básomo nzo a mbaa, lo básomo nzo a mbaa mu manyuru ma bo ya mu myaã mi baara. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Mu matala mamo be ka líli a Kriste o, be líili banzyi mu nsie a Isarayele, banzyi mu ogwihini ku misiini, ba bagwene a emiini ya ba bagwene a Nzaami mu nsie. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Lo mu matala ma, mu Yiisu-Kriste, be baala mu nsi-nkulu líili la, be ayi be-bele mu makili ma Kriste.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Mu kuulu me nde li edzuunu e bihi, nde wu aasi kuulu ti Ba-dzwife ya baala ka bali Ba-dzwife o bakala ekaana emõ. Bu aagwi nyuru a nde, nde aatsala ebagha kii eekakabala bo, ya ki eekalo etaara ŋa kara li bo. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Nde aasyehe Mikyene ekulu emõ ya mikele ya litumu li mye, mpaala mu ndeme, nde agyighili mu bo bansa buolo, mbwuru mutsyini wu munyaghara, mu osa edzuunu, <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />ya mu osa ogwihini ŋa kara li bansa buolo ya Nzaami mu nyuru nga-mõ mu kuruwa, bu amana mbele. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Nde aayagwa nsia, ti anga nsia yi mbwe, edzuunu kundaa be ba líli la, ya edzuunu kundaa ba báli be-bele. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Buulu mu nde, bihi bansa buolo lili a muswa mu osomo ŋa oli Taara mu Mufulu nga-mumõ.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Mu obo, be ka lifirisyili banzyi o, ngu okala baara ba baafi mu mansie makimi. Lo be ayi basi nsie emõ ya baba ngili, baara baba dzumu li Nzaami. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Be baatwu be ŋa yulu a bitsini bi bibagha bi nzo bi bili bantumu ya mibighili, ya Yiisu-Kriste ndeme li limeẽ lili ŋa mutswunu li liikakwara nzo . <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Me mu nde nzo yohono yiigwama ya yiitemene mu okala nzo a nzaami yi a ngili mu Mfumu. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Mu nde behe si bátwu be emõ mu okala nzo yi ookakala Nzaami mu Mufulu.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mansweghe ma Kriste</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Mu ndagha oyo, me Poole ndi mbwuru a boloko mu esala e Yiisu-Kriste mu nkooro a be, baala ka lili ba-Dzwife o... <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Kala ti be líigyughu, bwunu a bu oli esala e bwehe bu Nzaami ki bágwi me mu nkooro a be. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Mu limono baasuo me mansweghe ma Nzaami, ti bwunu a bu aansono me be mo mapfi-mapfi mu mukaana wu. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Bu litaã mukaana wu, be likughu obaghala mayele ma ndi a me mu mansweghe ma Kriste. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Mansweghe mamo ka básuo mo kundaa baana ba baara mu biseene bibike o ti anga bu baasuo mo mu matala ma mu Mufulu kundaa bantumu ba nde baba ngili ya mibighili: <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Mu osoolo ti baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o bali a pfa limõ lyini lilo, bali nyuru mõ gyini oyo, bali mu misiini myini mimye, mu Yiisu-Kriste mu nsia yi mbwe. <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Mu nkooro a Nsia yi Mbwe oyo me ayi musala, ti bwunu a bu oli ekaba e bwehe bu Nzaami bu baagwi kundaa me, mu nzili a bwehe bu nde.<verse eid="EPH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Kundaa me, me wu mbvulu busala mu mupfunu ŋa kara li baba ngili bwohono, baagwi me bwehe bubo buu otsala kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o muyighi a busini bu Kriste, ti anga nsia yi mbwe, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />ya mu osuo ŋa tse-tse kundaa baara bwohono omoŋono o mansweghe ma Nzaami, nde wu áagyighili bilogho byehene, ábunu mansweghe mamo obaana ku ebaana. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Mpaala mu nzili a libwunu li Nzaami, bamfumu ya ba baakatumu mu mayulu basoolo bunsughu bu Nzaami bubu bifa-bifa, <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />ti bwunu a bu aagyighili nde, mu Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste, bitsimi bi ákuru nde mu mibvu ya mibvu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Mu Yiisu-Kriste, ya mu kana li bihi mu nde, bihi lili a emiini ki ekughu mu obehene ya Nzaami mu kana. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Mu obo me nduomo be mu onyaã otsili bukyini mu nkooro a mpara yi ndi mu okamono me mu be. Mpara oyo yili nsia a be.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyaã Kriste akala mu mikolo mi be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Me mu obo me nkunu mabuo ŋa nkulu a Taara. <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />Me nde aakagwa nkwumu kundaa nswe dzumu li lili ku yulu ya ŋa nsie. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Mpaala mu busini bu nsia a nde, agwa be mpini ya lileene mu Mufulu a nde, mu nkooro a ndaana a mikolo mi be. <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />Nyaã Kriste akala munsa mikolo mi be mu kana, ya be limyehe midza ya likala ba bágwama mu dzyi, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />mpaala emõ ya baba ngili bwohono be lileene obaghala bunene, bula, muyighi, mutele, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />ya dzyi li Kriste li liluru ligyahaba lwohono. Mu obo be liilwulu mu busini bu Nzaami bwohono.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Kundaa munde wu kughu ogyighili ku obvulu mi liikaluomo ya mi liikatsimi bihi mu lileene li nde li liikasala mu bihi, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />kundaa nde nsia munsa libwunu li Nzaami ya mu Yiisu-Kriste, mu biseene byehene, mu mibvu ya mibvu. <char style="qt">Aamene!</char><verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Otwu nyuru a Kriste mu bumõ ya mu dzyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Mu obo, me ngwi be mpama, me wu ndi mu boloko mu kuulu me aakansalala Mfumu, mu okala a nzya-nzyara yi faana ya mbili yi líkihi be, <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />kunsa okughulu kwohono ya mu edzuunu, ya okakuru mukolo mu okebe. Mu dzyi, liikakuru mukolo mu nzya-nzyara a babake be a be, <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />bu lisi makpa mu okakebe bumõ bu ookagwa Mufulu mu munama wu edzuunu.<verse eid="EPH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Oli a nyuru yini a mõ ya Mufulu yini a mumõ, bumõ si Nzaami áti be mbili mu emiini yini a emõ.<verse eid="EPH 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Oli a Mfumu yini a mumõ, kana yini a limõ, liboghoro yini a limõ,<verse eid="EPH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Nzaami yini a mumõ ya Taara a bwohono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:6">wu aakatumu bwohono, wu aakasala mu bwohono, ya wu li mu bwohono.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Lo kundaa nswe mbwuru mu bihi, baagwi bwehe, ti bwunu a bu oli eteese ki ekaba e Kriste. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Me mu obo bályele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">
    <char style="qt">Ŋa ákumu nde ku yulu,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">
    <char style="qt">nde ábiri baara ba boloko, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">
    <char style="qt">nde ágwi baara bikaba.</char><verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />
    <char style="qt">Nde ákumu!</char> Bunu odzyi olyele, nsomo nde akumu, nde átswama okumunu ku nsini a nsie? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Munde wu aakumunu, me wuunu munde si aakumu ku nkara a mayulu mwohono, mpaala aluhu bilogho byehene.<verse eid="EPH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Ya nde aasi kuulu ti, bana bakala bantumu, babamõ mibighili, babake ba baakatsala nsia yi mbwe, ya babake minkaala bibuolo ya baluo. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Nde aasi obo mu kuulu baba ngili bakala ba bakughu mu osala esala kii otwu nyuru a Kriste, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />tee mu matala ma liito bihi bwohono mu bumõ bu kana ya ligyahaba li Mwana a Nzaami, ya bihi sa likala kara a mukughu ti anga Kriste wu li mukughu. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Mu obo, bihi ka lifirikala bike-bike o, ba ookanyihi mampo ma madza ya ba ookabiri bifulu bibi maluo. Bihi ka lifirikihi o ti bakaŋene ya ba bakadzihibi bihi mu mpya ya mayele baara ma mabi. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Lo bu liikalyele ngaŋma munsa dzyi, bihi lifaana okulu mu mandagha mwohono mu Kriste, nde wu li mutswi. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Me mu nde, binama bi nyuru byehe bibvuŋunu ebini emõ mu libaha li misunu ya mikaã. Mu obo, ŋa okasala nswe enama bwunu a bu ofaana, nyuru yohono yiikakulu mu dzyi.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbwuru wu mukulu ya mbwuru wu munyaghara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Mu obo, ndagha yi ndyele me ya yinsuo me be bumpughulu mu Mfumu me yi: Ka lifirikala a nzya-nzyara a baara ba bagwene osoolo Nzaami o, baala bitsimi bi bo yini a mu mandagha ma magwene a mupfunu. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Mayele ma bo mali kunsa mpyibi, ya bo bali banzyi mu bumweẽ bu Nzaami, mu nkooro a nzi-nzimini yi li mu bo ya mu nkooro a mikolo ngyi mi bo. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Bo ka baafirikamono bupfiri o, bo áyi batyeghe manyuru ma bo mu mandagha mama enkwunu, bo baakagyighili mandagha mama osuŋumu mama mawa-mawa.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Lo be, ka obo be liisoolo Kriste o, <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />kala ti me nde be liigyughu ya baaluo be, ti bwunu a bu oli engaŋma ki eli mu Yiisu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Lo be lifaana odzwulu embwuru e be ki ekulu ki efaana ya nzya-nzyara a be yi nkulu, ya ki eekabyihi kyeme mu manzala ma kye mama mpya. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Be lifaana okighiri mu mufulu mu mayele ma be <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />ya olaha embwuru ki enyaghara, ki baagyighili mu efa kii Nzaami, munsa bunsumu ya bungili bu buukaburu engaŋma.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Mu obo, linyaã mpya ya <char style="qt">nswe mbwuru mu be akalyele engaŋma kundaa nganda a nde</char>, mu kuulu bihi-a-be lili binama bibi nyuru mõ. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Mu matala ma liikabagha be nkehe, <char style="qt">ka likasa masumu o. Tala linyaã odzyama ŋaala be lili nkini ya nkehe</char>. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Ka likagwa mpeene kundaa dyabulu o. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Muturu anyaã ofirikaturu. Lo nde akasa mpini mu osala mu myaã mi nde esala ki ebwe, mpaala nde abagha ki aagwa kundaa wu aakeghele. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Ndagha si mõ yi mbi yinyaã opala mu miŋma mi be. Lo kala ti yo yipala, lo yikala yimbwe, yi aatwu, ya yi aagwa bwehe kundaa ba baagyughu yo. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Ka likagwa Mufulu a Ngili a Nzaami nyiĩ o, mu kuulu mu nde bási be elyimi mu etsughu ki akala ookwulu be Nzaami. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Limaha ŋa kara be nkala, kakaba, nkehe, kyele, bitughu, ya mandagha mwohono ma mabi. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Liikakala baara ba babwe ya banga a mikolo nyiĩ be a be, liikasa be a be kolokolo, ti bwunu a bu ósi be Nzaami kolokolo mu Kriste.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Be lifaana okanama bwunu a bu oli Nzaami, ti anga baana baba mukolo, <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />ya liikakala mu dzyi ti bwunu a bu ódzyi bihi-a-be Kriste. Nde ágwi nyuru a nde kundaa Nzaami ti anga ekaba ya mukaba wu otsughu mu nkooro a bihi-a-be, ti anga mananaase mama mpihi yi mbwe.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Ti anga bu ofaana kundaa baba ngili, banyaã ofirikataŋana ŋa kara li be enkwunu, mandagha mama osuŋumu mama mawa-mawa, ntono a nzi. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Mbiili yi budzwa, mbiili yi buwulu bwunu we yi mbi ka yifaana ŋa kara li be o. Lo be lifaana okabvurulu matuono. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Mu kuulu, ligyighili osoolo ti: Mbwuru si mumõ mu banga-a-enkwunu, baba suŋumu, banga a ntono a nzi (ekye me efaana kii osamana ba nzaami baba mpya), ka babagha pfa mu Emfumu e Kriste ya kii Nzaami o.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu nsi-nkulu mpyibi yi a laŋa-laŋa, mu matala ma ayi otsyeme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Mbwuru anyaã opfiri be mu mbiili yi mukaŋana. Mu kuulu mu nkooro yo nkehe a Nzaami yiigya ŋa yulu a ba baakatemene a Nde ngangala. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Ka likala a mfwunu mõ ya bo o. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Mu kuulu, mu nsi-nkulu be líili mpyibi yi a laŋa-laŋa, lo mu matala ma be lili otsyeme mu Mfumu. Liikakala ti anga baana baba otsyeme. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Mu kuulu, mimburu mi otsyeme me bubwe, bunsumu, engaŋma. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Ligyahaba likeene mandagha ma maakagwa Mfumu esee, <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />ya ka likakala bumõ mu bigyighili bi bigwene a mupfunu bibi mpyibi o. Lo liikafwunu bye. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Mu kuulu, mandagha ma ookagyighili baara babo mu ensweghe mali mama budzwa mu obili mu mo. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Lo bu bafwunu mandagha mamo, mo mamoŋono ŋa otsyeme bu mali mo. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Mu kuulu mandagha mwohono maala ayi ma maamoŋono mo mali otsyeme. Mu obo baakalyele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Sighili, we wuli ensama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">temene ŋa kara li ba bápki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">ya Kriste sa atwulu we kunsa otsyeme.<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Liikasa mayele mu nzya-nzyara a be: Ka likakala ti anga biwulu o, lo liikakala ti anga banga-a-munzeele, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Lisalala matala mukuulu bitsughu bili bibi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Mu obo, ka likala baara ba bagwene a mayele o, lo libaghala waa li Mfumu bunu lili.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Ka likakolo bviini o, mo maakabiri ku odzimini, lo likala ba bálwulu mu Mufulu. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Liikagwa be a be mpama mu bikwumu, bikwumu bibi nsia ya bikwumu bi ógwi Mufulu, likagyimi ya likagwa Mfumu nsia mu mukolo a be ndehene. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Mu matala mwohono, mu mandagha mwohono, likabvuhulu matuono kundaa munde wu li Nzaami Taara mu nkwumu a Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balumu ya bakala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Be ba likagwa Kriste budziri, likakihi litumu li babamõ be a be. <verse eid="EPH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Bakaha, liikakihi litumu li balumu ba be ti anga bu liikakihi be litumu li Mfumu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Mu kuulu baghala li mfumu a mukaha, ti anga bu oli Kriste mfumu a Libwunu, li lili nyuru a nde, yi ali nde mubvwuhu. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Lo, bwunu a bu ookakihi Libwunu litumu li Kriste, nyaã bakaha si bakakihi litumu li balumu ba bo mu mandagha mwohono.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Balumu, liikadzyi bakala ba be ti anga bu ódzyi Kriste Libwunu ya nde ndeme ágwi nyuru a nde mu nkooro a lo. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Obo nde ádzyi osa lo lili ngili bu atsehebe lo mu madza ma maakaswagha ya mu Ndagha, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />mpaala nde asuo ŋa nkulu a ndeme libwunu li libwe, li ligwene a mpiri, ngu okala mikara, ngu okala elogho ki ebi, lo likala libwunu li lingili ya li ligwene a epfwumu. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Bwunu obo si balumu bafaana odzyi bakala ba bo, ti anga manyuru a bomo. Munde wu aakadzyi mukala a nde, nde dzyi nyuru a ndeme.<verse eid="EPH 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Mbwuru nkini ka ámaabele nyuru a ndeme o, lo nde aakabuŋunu yo ya aakasa yo bunkere ti anga bu ookasa Kriste mu libwunu, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />mu kuulu bihi-a-be lili binama bi nyuru a nde. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" /><char style="qt">Me mu obo baghala sa asihi taara ya ngughu a nde, sa anabara ya mukala a nde, ya bansa buolo sa bakala nyuru mõ </char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eba 2.24.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Mamo mali mansweghe ma manene. Me, me ndyele ti mo matala Kriste ya Libwunu li Nzaami. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Ngu mu obo, nyaã mumõ-mumõ mu be adzyi mukala a nde ti anga ndeme, ya mukala agwa mulumu a nde budziri.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Baana ya biburu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Baana, liikakihi litumu li biburu bi be, mu kuulu, obo oli bunsumu mu Mfumu. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" /><char style="qt">Gwa taara ya ngughu a we budziri</char>, munde me mukyene wu a nsomo wu li ya misiini: <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" /><char style="qt">mpaala we kala a esee ya we laama ŋa nsie </char>.<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Be bataara, ka likagwa baana ba be nkehe o, lo liikakwuhu bo kunsa maluo ya mu bigyehe bi Mfumu.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bankana ya bamfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Bankana, liikasa bintamana kundaa bamfumu ba be baba ŋa nsie kunsa nzalamweẽ ya oteghere, mu mukolo wu bunya-nyaã, ti anga be ba lili mu okasa bintamana kundaa Kriste. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Ka likasa obo yini a ŋa mihi mi bo o, ti anga mu omoŋono bubwe kundaa baara, lo likakihi litumu ti anga bankana ba Kriste ba baakagyighili waa li Nzaami mu mukolo mumõ. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Liikasalala bo mu mukolo mumõ ti anga be lili mu okasalala Mfumu, lo ka ti anga ba bali mu okasalala baara o, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />bu lisoolo ti, nswe mbwuru, ngu ali nkana bwunu we mbwuru wu bunya-nyaã, ndeme sa abagha mufuru kundaa Mfumu mu mandagha ma mabwe ma aakagyighili nde.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Kundaa be bamfumu, liikasa bwunu obo si kundaa bankana ba be. Linyaã miŋaana, bu lisoolo Mfumu a bo ya wu a ndaa be li mu mayulu, ya nde ka li a munsuolo a bidzili o.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bidzwana bi ookagwa Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Mu omana, libagha mpini mu Mfumu, mu litumu li lileene li nde lwohono. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Lilaha bidzwana bi Nzaami byehene mpaala be lileene otemene ŋa nkulu a bigyighili bi dyabulu bibi emfiri-a-mpya. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Mu kuulu, ekyini ki lili a kye, ka eli kii odzwana mu musunu ya makili o, lo kii odzwana a bimpu, bamfumu ya lileene bi nsie yi a mpyibi yi a laŋa-laŋa yi, ekyini kii odzwana a lileene li mifulu mi mibi mi mili ku yulu, ŋa kara li mayulu ya nsie. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Mu obo, ligwolo bidzwana bi Nzaami byehene, mpaala be likala a mpini mu etsughu ki ebi ya bu limana ogyighili mandagha mwohono, be litemene bubwe. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Mu obo, ligyighili otemene! Lilaha engaŋma ti anga muswele mu bala, ya lilaha bunsumu ti anga enkuru kii mu bisyeẽ ki eekakyi butulu. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Lilaha ti anga bikoghoro mu myili mi be mana maa otsala Nsia yi Mbwe yi edzuunu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Mu matala mwohono, ligwolo kana ti anga likubu, mu lo be lileene odzihibi magyo ma mbaa mama Wu Mubi. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Ligwolo si obvwughu ti anga mpu yi esyeẽ ya Ndagha a Nzaami ti anga lipee lili Mufulu.<verse eid="EPH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Mu libaha li Mufulu, liikasamana mu Mufulu mu nswe matala mu nsa-nsamana yi mawa-mawa ya yi a opele. Mu obo likahala mihi ya mu nswe matala lisa mukama mu okapele Nzaami mu nkooro a baba ngili bwohono. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Liikasamana mu nkooro a mehe si, mpaala Nzaami agwa me ndagha yi olyele mu matala ma akala aandzubulu me muŋma mu otsala mu kana nsia a mansweghe ma Nsia yi Mbwe. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Mu nkooro a ndagha oyo me ndi embala kii Nsia yi Mbwe, wu bákuru misyi mimi bisyeẽ. Mu obo liikasamana mpaala me kambili ya kana mu Nsia yi Mbwe bwunu a bu mfaana me obili mu yo.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mamboro mama masini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tisyike sa agwa be mansia mwohono, mpaala behe si lisoolo mandagha ma matala me ya ma ndi mu okagyighili me. Nde li ndughu mu kana wu mukolo, musala a Mfumu wu bakughu osa kana mu nde. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Me ngweghe be nde mu mpere mpaala be lisoolo mandagha ma matala bihi, ya mpaala nde agwa be bukyini.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Nyaã edzuunu, dzyi ya kana bi bifi kundaa Nzaami Taara, ya kundaa Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste bikala ya bandughu mu kana! <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Nyaã bwehe bukala ya babo bwohono ba baakadzyi Mfumu a bihi Yiisu-Kriste mu dzyi li liigwene okabyi!<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>